{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/extras/158a49d2eb09ef10966af7cffe08efd7.avif?t=1759246548\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span>ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Money: Trial by Combat</strong> throws you into the raw, unforgiving streets of Pineville\u2014a city ruled by fists, fear, and fractured alliances. Choose between an older ex-con reclaiming his name or a younger brawler fighting to make his own. In this brutal slice of urban survival, there are no rules\u2014only scars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/extras/3fe980041344e5e21633a2ffe1aa23ec.avif?t=1759246548\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span>\ud83e\udd4a Stylized Street Fighting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master hand-to-hand combat with freeform attacks, brutal combos, and special moves. Block, dodge, counter, or finish your enemy in cinematic syncs that feel impactful and personal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/extras/0ee470407526df7c99b9051b5b4347b1.avif?t=1759246548\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span>\ud83c\udf06 Gritty Urban World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From back alleys to rooftop brawls, every fight takes place in a handcrafted environment inspired by the raw energy of Oakland California. Trash blows in the wind. Spectators shout from balconies. Streetlights flicker behind you as the punches land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/extras/b8f6b7a47025b6230e5a02fc8d25b622.avif?t=1759246548\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span>\ud83d\udc80 Gang Tension in Every Corner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle members of Pineville\u2019s most dangerous gangs. Each faction has its own fighting style, territory, and attitude. Represent yourself or go down swinging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/extras/b4dd289b2da31f10c86ef51057f97ac5.avif?t=1759246548\" width=800 height=89 /></span>\ud83d\udd25 Choose Your Champion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Older P.C.</strong> \u2014 weathered, methodical, and looking for redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Younger P.C.</strong> \u2014 fast, reckless, and out to prove himself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fighter has a distinct moveset, style, and attitude shaped by the streets they came from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two character paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy gang A.I.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three jaw crushing arenas (Subway, Rooftop, and Fast Food Parking Lot)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826390?t=1759246548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/edfcd341aa77407f08293350e52c4cef679d5763/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759246548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/9577fac73241ac399009e47c526190e15c3c156e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759246548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826390/9577fac73241ac399009e47c526190e15c3c156e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759246548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller su